{
  "name": "极端案例·超长文本与极小尺寸",
  "width": 800,
  "height": 600,
  "background": "#f8fafc",
  "version": 1,
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "long-text",
      "type": "text",
      "name": "超长自动缩排文本",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 260,
      "rotation": 0,
      "fill": "#111111",
      "text": "这是一段用于压力测试的极端长文本：海报编辑器必须在没有任何空格的连续中文句子上正确换行，例如「超级超级超级超级超级超级超级超级超级超级超级超级超级超级超级长标题」，并且在开启自动缩小字号后仍能保持每一行都落在文本框内部，不允许静默截断任何一个字符；同时混入 English words without boundaries ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ0123456789 和数字 9999999999999999999999999999 来验证混排稳定性。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontWeight": 400,
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "fontFamily": "sans",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoFit": true,
      "crop": null
    },
    {
      "id": "tiny-rect",
      "type": "rect",
      "name": "极小尺寸矩形",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 3,
      "height": 3,
      "rotation": 0,
      "fill": "#ef4444",
      "cornerRadius": 0,
      "crop": null
    },
    {
      "id": "off-canvas",
      "type": "ellipse",
      "name": "故意越界椭圆",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 220,
      "rotation": 0,
      "fill": "#0ea5e9",
      "crop": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cropped-star",
      "type": "star",
      "name": "被裁切的星形",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 160,
      "height": 160,
      "rotation": 0,
      "fill": "#f97316",
      "starPoints": 6,
      "crop": { "x": 30, "y": 20, "width": 90, "height": 90 }
    },
    {
      "id": "overflow-label",
      "type": "text",
      "name": "关闭自适应的溢出文本",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 44,
      "rotation": 0,
      "fill": "#7c3aed",
      "text": "固定字号且不自动缩小的一段明显超过文本框容量的文字内容 ABCDEFG",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontWeight": 700,
      "fontStyle": "italic",
      "fontFamily": "serif",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "autoFit": false,
      "crop": null
    }
  ]
}
